      "title": "Bound retained full-text input history",
      "message": "Every accepted edit retains its complete text snapshot for the lifetime of the fixture. Typing or repeatedly editing a large field accumulates memory proportional to the sum of all document versions, not the current document size. With automatic exit disabled, this history grows indefinitely; serializing it in save() also requires another large allocation and can stall shutdown.",
